- How would you automate feature flag rollout across multiple geographic regions while maintaining compliance?
- How would you measure and detect model quality drift in real-time for production traffic?
- How would you handle tenant-specific model customization while maintaining canary isolation?
- What strategies would you use to ensure fair load distribution during canary rollouts?

